<p>You conceal spring loaded blades within your equipment. On scoring a critical strike, you follow up with your blades for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180%</acronym> damage (as an unarmed attack).</p><p>This talent has a cooldown.</p><p><span style="color: #ffff00"><span class="tstr-color-YELLOW">Prepared with: not prepared</span></span></p>